From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Afonchenko <undermove1@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 11:07:21 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] Meridian: Studio never asks for a folder; each task gets its
 own

Studio opens ~/Documents/Meridian Studio by itself (studioHome); a new task
gets "<its words>, <date>" there (studioTaskFolder) and Claude Code starts
in it (ptyCreate taskDir, kept with the session for a restart). The
person's own folder stays possible; there tasks work in it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SwxrQ2eLfJ2bv8cCoG2va1
